evals/README.md:42:Ten ordinary cases (`fe-vs-<id>-navigator`; the asset folders keep their `fe-vs-<id>-investigate` names) on the NDA bench repo in `../ambicode-evals-assets`, rendered by
evals/README.md:43:`scripts/navigator-cases.mjs` (also run by `npm run evals:generate`) into `evals/cases/navigator/` (plugin arm) and
evals/README.md:44:`evals/bare/navigator/` (bare arm). Both are gitignored: they hold ticket text and truth paths. Without the assets the generator
evals/README.md:48:npm run evals -- --tag navigator        # plugin arm, one harness call, -j 4
evals/README.md:49:npm run evals:bare -- --tag navigator   # bare arm
evals/README.md:53:  bench's `.ambicode/context/` back in, because the navigator reads only that; the bare scaffold copies nothing.
evals/README.md:55:  measures the navigator alone: `allowed_tools: [Agent]`, no `--allow-tools` shell grant, and an `append_system_prompt` that makes
